{{also|gender-bender}}
==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-gender bender.ogg|a=AU}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic|colloquial}} A person who [[dress]]es in the clothes of another [[sex]], or in clothes which make their gender identity ambiguous.
# {{lb|en|by extension}} An event where people are encouraged to dress in the clothes of another sex, even if they would normally not.
# {{lb|en|fantasy}} A person capable of changing their physical sex.
# {{lb|en|fantasy}} An instance of someone's physical sex being changed, usually via [[magic]].

